   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The relation gives \\( f'(0) = 4 \\). Differentiate the relation, using the chain rule on each term that holds \\( f \\): \\( f'' = 2 f f' + 1 \\).",
         "mathjson": 4
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Evaluate in order at \\( x = 0 \\), feeding each value into the next: \\( f'(0) = 4 \\), \\( f''(0) = 17 \\).",
         "mathjson": 17
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Divide each value by the matching factorial: \\( \\frac{2}{0!} = 2 \\), \\( \\frac{4}{1!} = 4 \\), \\( \\frac{17}{2!} = \\frac{17}{2} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
